{
    "title": "KFC US - Ordering App",
    "description": "Where finger lickin' good deals meet finger lickin' good food. Order your favorites with our easy-to-use app.\r\n\r\nEarn KFC Rewards for Free Food\r\n\r\nKFC customers can unlock free KFC by earning points on orders through their Rewards Account via the app.*\r\n\r\nExclusive Deals & Discounts\r\nFind exclusive deals only available here. Save on your favorite meals and try new limited time offers here first.\r\n\r\nOrder for Quick Pick-up or Delivery\r\nPick up your order in-store or have it delivered with contactless options.\r\n\r\nQuick & Simple Ordering\r\nBrowse the menu, customize your meal, and place your order in just a few taps. Choose from all your fave fried chicken, sandwiches, sides, and desserts.\r\n\r\nCustomizable Menu Options\r\nChoose from a variety of sides, sauces, and sweets to go with your Nuggets, Tenders, or Fried Chicken.\r\n\r\nSecure Payment Options\r\nPay securely with credit/debit cards, Apple Pay, and Google Pay.\r\n\r\nDownload today!\r\n\r\n*KFC Rewards program only available with online orders at participating KFC restaurants in the U.S.  Account creation required.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Where finger lickin&#39; good deals meet finger lickin&#39; good food. Order your favorites with our easy-to-use app.<br><br>Earn KFC Rewards for Free Food<br><br>KFC customers can unlock free KFC by earning points on orders through their Rewards Account via the app.*<br><br>Exclusive Deals &amp; Discounts<br>Find exclusive deals only available here. Save on your favorite meals and try new limited time offers here first.<br><br>Order for Quick Pick-up or Delivery<br>Pick up your order in-store or have it delivered with contactless options.<br><br>Quick &amp; Simple Ordering<br>Browse the menu, customize your meal, and place your order in just a few taps. Choose from all your fave fried chicken, sandwiches, sides, and desserts.<br><br>Customizable Menu Options<br>Choose from a variety of sides, sauces, and sweets to go with your Nuggets, Tenders, or Fried Chicken.<br><br>Secure Payment Options<br>Pay securely with credit/debit cards, Apple Pay, and Google Pay.<br><br>Download today!<br><br>*KFC Rewards program only available with online orders at participating KFC restaurants in the U.S.  Account creation required.",
